*   **convenience_feature_score**: FlexDoors are a unique convenience feature for access. FlexSpace seating system is standard. FlexFloor system is standard. Electric parking brake is standard. FlexRail storage system was standard on some trims. Front and rear parking sensors were standard on higher trims like SE/Tech Line. Optional Flex-Fix bike carrier was available. Score: 0.75.
